                                                "text": "Her rich, becoming dress fitted her perfect shape most admirably, and Fanchette had never arranged her coiffure to more advantage; the rich lappet of blonde, carelessly tied under the chin, hid all the \"defeatures time had made,\" without hiding the long white throat, for which she had always been remarkable, and was a beauty which had descended to all her daughters, even to the stigmatized Isabella."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "29c64c8d-3ae5-4b0a-9075-634f78709774",
                                                "sense_id": "9482339c-5849-3c0d-8928-cf968cadced3",
                                                "text": "I have small breasts that lie flattened against the chest like lappets."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "903f0560-8c38-4772-921a-60a4c12d9ce5",
                                                "sense_id": "9482339c-5849-3c0d-8928-cf968cadced3",
                                                "text": "She raises her face to the light. ‘How do you think I look? What will you say of me when the king asks you? I have not seen myself in a mirror these many months.’ She pats her fur cap, pulls its lappets over her ears; laughs."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5bbc30e7-821d-306f-8973-f82746c46ba3",
                                        "entry_id": "aff14055-37e0-3d96-baa9-0900f010a20f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A wattle or flap-like structure on the face."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "26b872bc-c4a4-4218-9101-58b9def59a34",
                                                "sense_id": "5bbc30e7-821d-306f-8973-f82746c46ba3",
                                                "text": "Some vultures have lappets of bare flesh on the sides of the head."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8656dbc7-f568-4ac7-8412-e1db09a7034b",
                                                "sense_id": "5bbc30e7-821d-306f-8973-f82746c46ba3",
                                                "text": "Tompot blennies are distinguished by a pair of lappets above the eyes and dark stripes along the body."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2807960f-2591-3445-b06a-c66027323fac",
                                        "entry_id": "aff14055-37e0-3d96-baa9-0900f010a20f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A head-dress made with lappets for lace pendants."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "046a441e-4eb9-34bd-88b1-6e364a75d060",
                                        "entry_id": "aff14055-37e0-3d96-baa9-0900f010a20f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A lobe (division of an organ)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "656e33a1-8235-448b-960d-222ee9c3f380",
                                                "sense_id": "046a441e-4eb9-34bd-88b1-6e364a75d060",
                                                "text": "In the tender lappet of the eare is supposed to rest the seat of remembrance, which we vse to touch when we mean to take one to beare witnesse of an arrest or other thing done,"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "53422cf6-be6c-42a2-b60e-ecd19f73bfa1",
                                                "sense_id": "046a441e-4eb9-34bd-88b1-6e364a75d060",
                                                "text": "[…] he ran him in with the spit a little above the navel, towards the right flank, till he pierced the third lappet of his liver,"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "lappet",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f5f3a4f8-d414-30b6-b7b3-89cfa3fb8ce7",
                                        "entry_id": "e7449a67-9290-3f5d-8a32-27686bc58461",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To decorate with, or as if with, lappets."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ec912633-c499-417c-919d-fa0b2b5e1f24",
                                                "sense_id": "f5f3a4f8-d414-30b6-b7b3-89cfa3fb8ce7",
                                                "text": "I would fain merit your esteem, heedless of these pursy fellows from hulks and warehouses, with one ear lappetted by the pen behind it […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
